Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:52:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] Android: open documents sent with "Open with" and
 "Share"

The launch intent's documents join the startup batch like command-line
files, and documents sent to the running app open like a second-instance
request (QtAndroidPrivate's new-intent listener). URIs are read on the
Android UI thread and copied into working copies on the GUI thread.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
